			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"I. Input and output ports\n\nInput\n\nImage: picture to picture / pad picture, input reference picture\n\nSref: MJ exclusive style reference map (Style Reference), specially extracting picture painting style, tone, brushstrokes, do not copy the subject, only copy the style, V8.1 focuses on strengthening functions\n\nApi_config: Connect to your Midjourney / third-party transit API key to call the cloud interface\n\nPrompt: prompt input box, write a picture description\n\nSend out\n\nImage: the finally generated picture\n\nUrl: MJ Cloud Original Picture Link\n\nResponse: The complete generated information returned by MJ (seed, parameters, version, etc.)\n\nII. Detailed function of each parameter (fully corresponding to MJ native instructions)\n\nChaos: 0–100, the higher the value, the stronger the randomness of the picture and the greater the brain hole, 0 is the stable reproduction prompt\n\nQuality (image quality): MJ native --q parameter, 1 is the default high-definition, the higher the detail, the slower the generation, and the higher the deduction.\n\nStylize: 0–1000, control the intensity of AI art rendering; the higher the picture, the more artistic and abstract, the lower the picture, the more realistic and fitting the prompts\n\nRaw: true/false, turn on and turn off MJ with its own aesthetic filter, completely realistic, reduce artistic rendering, suitable for product drawings and realistic photography\n\nIw (picture weight): control the influence of the reference picture on the picture, 1 is the default, the higher the reference picture body\n\nSw (style weight): specially control the intensity of sref style reference map, 0–100, the higher the reference picture style\n\nSv (version): corresponding to MJ V8.1 version fine-tuning branch, 6 is the current V8.1 stable version\n\naspectRatio: 1:1, 16:9, 9:16, etc., directly set the aspect ratio of the canvas\n\nHd: true/false, turn on the native 2K HD mode, V8.1 optimized HD mode is faster and cheaper\n\nSkip_error: The error report is automatically skipped to prevent a single failure from jamming the whole workflow when batching.\n\nSeed: Fixed seeds can reproduce exactly the same picture 1:1, 0 is random seeds.\n\nControl_after_generate: seed follow-up generation logic (fixed / incremental / random), batch workflow\n\nIII. Core use\n\nUse the latest model of Midjourney V8.1 directly in ComfyUI without opening Discord.\n\nSupport literary pictures, pictures, style reference, perfectly reproduce MJ high-end texture\n\nAccess the ComfyUI workflow to realize batch output, multi-picture linkage, and controllable processization\n\nWith RH and other nodes, do MJ+SD hybrid workflow, taking into account MJ painting style + SD local control"
			],
